        "line": 15,
        "text": "The `program` subcommand of `bw_bmc_fpga_load` is designed to efficiently program files to FPGA flash. To further enhance the integrity and reliability of this tool, we have introduced a valuable feature in SDK-2024.4.1. This enhancement automatically verifies the hash of the programmed file against the hash in the flash device post-programming, offering an additional layer of assurance for users. This feature is available in BMC3 version 1.1.0 and later, providing users with the latest advancements in programming accuracy."
